.claude/skills/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# INTERNAL WORKBENCH — never committed.
#
# The final round is marked partly on the repository a reviewer clones: the
# README is read first, and C4a asks a stranger to deploy from it in under 30
# minutes. Anything that is not part of that story lives here instead — internal
# status notes, the pitch deck, design experiments, and the organisers' own PDFs
# (their material, not our authored work). Nothing here is deleted; it is simply
# not part of the deliverable.
_workbench/

# Multi-session coordination state (tools/session_claim.py). Runtime bookkeeping
# between concurrent Claude Code sessions, meaningless to anyone cloning the repo.
.sessions/

# Superseded by _workbench/ but kept so an older checkout stays clean
docs/precompute-corpus.md
docs/video-script.md
docs/roadmap-final-round.html
docs/paper/

# Panel-issued finalist material. Not our authored work, and the orientation pack is
# issued to finalists rather than published, so it is not ours to make public in a repo
# the rules require to be public. The DERIVED artefacts are committed and are what the
# pipeline actually reads — data/rdtii/indicator_reference.json (built by
# tools/build_indicator_reference.py from the framework PDFs) and
# data/ground_truth/rdtii_reference_p67.csv (built from the two Databases). Drop these
# three lines to include the sources if the organisers confirm they may be redistributed.
Finalist Orientation/
RDTII 2.1 framework documentations/
Khảo sát các quốc gia cho vòng 2.xlsx

# --- Client apps (apps/) ---
# Everything here is build output or a fetched dependency tree; all of it is
# reproduced by `npm ci` and `tauri build`. target/ alone is ~1 GB.
node_modules/
apps/*/dist/
apps/shell/src-tauri/target/
# Regenerated by `tauri build` and by `tauri ios/android init`.
apps/shell/src-tauri/gen/
apps/web/src/generated/*.map

# --- Ledger tenant output ---
# Derived from the run records; reproduced by `ledger product`.
bench/out/
